<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CKS Group raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CKS Group raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said analyst Michael Parekh raised the rating on CKS Group Inc to the recommended list from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose four to 27-1/2.</p>
</text>
